OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'We don't all breathe the same
OL,4,Aair': How London's pollution gap
OL,5,Apersists
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhen her nine-year-old daughter died of
OL,8,Fan asthma attack in 2013, Rosamund
OL,9,FAdoo-Kissi-Debrah had never heard about
OL,10,Fair pollution being a possible trigger
OL,11,Ffor asthma.
OL,13,FAfter a medical report suggested a
OL,14,Fdirect link between Ella's illness and
OL,15,Fillegal air pollution levels near her
OL,16,Fhome, an inquest into her death was
OL,17,Fopened. Ella became the first person in
OL,18,Fthe UK to have air pollution listed on
OL,19,Fher death certificate.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32402
