PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1788018947
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'We don't all breathe the same
OL,4,Aair': How London's pollution gap
OL,5,Apersists
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe coroner recorded that "there was a
OL,8,Frecognised failure to reduce the level
OL,9,Fof nitrogen dioxide to within the
OL,10,Flimits set by EU and domestic law".
OL,12,FA spokesperson from the Department for
OL,13,FEnvironment, Food and Rural Affairs
OL,14,F(Defra) told the BBC that the
OL,15,Fgovernment was committed to reducing
OL,16,Fair pollution, which "robs people of
OL,17,Ftheir health and costs the NHS millions
OL,18,Fof pounds every year".
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
